      "title": "Anthropic Claude SDK Engine",
      "items": [
        "Native Anthropic client with Claude 3.5 / 3.7 models",
        "Prompt Caching: caches system prompt, MCP tool schemas, and conversation history",
        "Thinking Budgets: configurable effort and token budgets for deep reasoning",
        "Gantry Model Gateway: routes via Anthropic API, AWS Bedrock (SigV4), or GCP Vertex AI"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "DeepAgents / LangChain Engine",
      "items": [
        "LangChain & LangGraph execution graph with stream normalizer",
        "Sandboxed StateBackend: disables raw OS shell/filesystem; limits to virtual /skills/**",
        "MCP Facade: exposes Gantry-owned tools while blocking unsafe built-in task tools",
        "DeepAgentCheckpointSaver: serializes state graph checkpoints between turns"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Subprocess Isolation & IPC Bridge",
      "items": [
        "Runner processes execute in isolated Node.js child processes",
        "Config is passed over stdin; output is streamed over framed stdout markers",
        "Live steering, human-in-the-loop approvals, and cancellation arrive via GANTRY_IPC_INPUT_DIR"
      ]
    }
